  storyText: "Agent Voss\n\nOutside, a man in a grey coat leans on a black car. No gang colors. No corp logo. \"Agent Voss, NetWatch. Give me the shard and you walk. Nobody needs to know.\"\n\n1. Hand it over.\n2. Run.\n3. Go back into the church."
